    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to our &quot;Bad Teams&quot; game, we were very happy to see you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558050/extras/bfab89a710418a579cc00d2f4440dc00.poster.avif?t=1754988950\" width=350 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558050/extras/bfab89a710418a579cc00d2f4440dc00.webm?t=1754988950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what kind of game is Bad Teams?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have many new concepts such as fighting, football, track races, hide and seek, where you can race cars with your friends, compete fiercely on the tracks, and customize them with your characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends can enjoy our special concept games that support up to 12 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will add new content to our game in line with the community's suggestions, and the necessary corrections will be made as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558050/extras/f332f0184dc14fea7d994ad437186c1a.poster.avif?t=1754988950\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558050/extras/f332f0184dc14fea7d994ad437186c1a.webm?t=1754988950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun and have a pleasant time with your friends. Good luck everyone</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to our &quot;Bad Teams&quot; game, we were very happy to see you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558050/extras/bfab89a710418a579cc00d2f4440dc00.poster.avif?t=1754988950\" width=350 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558050/extras/bfab89a710418a579cc00d2f4440dc00.webm?t=1754988950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what kind of game is Bad Teams?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have many new concepts such as fighting, football, track races, hide and seek, where you can race cars with your friends, compete fiercely on the tracks, and customize them with your characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends can enjoy our special concept games that support up to 12 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will add new content to our game in line with the community's suggestions, and the necessary corrections will be made as you wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558050/extras/f332f0184dc14fea7d994ad437186c1a.poster.avif?t=1754988950\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558050/extras/f332f0184dc14fea7d994ad437186c1a.webm?t=1754988950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun and have a pleasant time with your friends. Good luck everyone</p>",
    "short_description": "You can race with your friends, fight on the tracks and have fun. All you have to do is show that you are better than everyone else. Bad luck.",
